{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t警方凌晨接報，屯門安定邨一名男子報稱其9歲女兒持刀企圖傷害自己，他上前阻止，奪刀期間懷疑不小心傷及女兒胸口，女童清醒送屯門醫院治理。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n事發於凌晨4時40分左右，男子事後被帶返警方協助調查，案件暫列作傷人。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：汪溟曦\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T04:04:34.658021+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:32:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:38:37.870499+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T03:58:28.168628+00:00","content_hash":"d7d911c4f593d2a43f26eae8840fbc17e96c69673bc5a724e7d091ae54b133bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}